2. `TestBCompatibility` asserts that `calc.Version() != 1 && !calc.Compatible()` is never true — i.e. **any version other than 1 must also report compatibility support**.

The specification (`docs/architecture/architecture.yaml` plus `CLAUDE.md`) names `services/calc` as both the service path and the sole writable tree. The defect is entirely inside that tree; the tests are the specification and must not be touched.

